 <name>fast_xdebug</name>
 <channel>pecl.php.net</channel>
 <summary>Fast, Xdebug-API-compatible code coverage (line, branch, path) for PHP.</summary>
 <description>
fast-xdebug is a PHP Zend extension that provides code coverage (line, branch
and path) through the Xdebug coverage API, so PHPUnit / php-code-coverage /
Cobertura tooling consume it unchanged. It analyses each op_array into basic
blocks once and records one byte per executed block at runtime, reconstructing
lines/branches/paths at collection time. Branch and path coverage therefore
cost about the same at runtime as line coverage -- roughly an order of
magnitude faster than Xdebug for path coverage. Coverage only (no debugger,
profiler or tracer).
 </description>
 <lead>
  <name>Linas Jusys</name>
  <user>juslintek</user>
