  <release>alpha</release>
  <api>alpha</api>
 </stability>
 <license uri="https://opensource.org/licenses/BSD-2-Clause">BSD-2-Clause</license>
 <notes>
0.2.0: adds a Cachegrind profiler (~5x faster than Xdebug's profiler) via
zend_observer, alongside the existing line/branch/path coverage. Step
debugging (DBGp) is specified but not yet implemented. PHP 8.2-8.5, NTS/ZTS.
 </notes>
